From 40aa8deb0dcef2f35e1444937f3472b3c5f4efe2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 03:48:38 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Work automation, rich text, live boards, roadmap, alerts,
 templates, reports, GitHub App; long recordings with speakers, emailed
 invites, learned call filing; scale fixes

Work management
- Automation rules per project: when created / state changed / field changed / commented / daily at an hour,
  if a work query matches, then move, set fields, assign (person, reporter, component lead, round-robin,
  least busy), comment, notify (app + email), post to Teams / Slack / Google Chat, create a child, add
  watchers; smart values; loop guard (3 levels), savepoint per rule, auto-off after 5 errors, run now
- Markdown descriptions and comments with toolbar, preview, mentions, pasted / dropped images;
  attachments on work items (25 MB each, history entries)
- Live boards: a cheap change stamp polled every 5 s while visible refreshes work queries
- Portfolio roadmap across projects (/work/roadmap): epics and features on a timeline, drag to move or
  resize, dates from children when not set
- Email alerts with per-person preferences (instant / daily digest / off), due-soon digest, outbox sweep
- Project templates: built-in Scrum, Kanban support, Bug tracking; save a project's setup as a template
- Reports: sprint report (committed / added / removed / completed), time in each state, release burn-up
- Workspace rule that every active project needs a repository (projects can be marked "no code")

GitHub App
- Install per workspace, repository picker, "Synapse work items" check run on pushes and PRs,
  require the check on the main branch, create branches from work items, uninstall handling

Calls
- Speaker labels with Workers AI Deepgram Nova-3 (Whisper fallback), naming speakers in the transcript
- Long recordings: MP3 / WAV split on the server, other formats cut into WAV parts in the browser
- Invitations attached to emails (.ics) filed like calendar invites, de-duplicated by iCalendar UID
- Call filing learns from moving calls to projects (recurring title, outside people, company domain)

Upkeep and scale
- Intel test no longer depends on the time of day
- 12,000-item scale test (WORK_SCALE=1); bounded task list, backlog, hierarchy and item children;
  cumulative flow and release burn-up rewritten to linear time; JIT off per request transaction;
  hash joins for reports on tables without statistics; new indexes (migration 0064)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01GzduCoCyWxU3cg7naxMvaE
